<div id="u-credit-00044-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ahshow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1418801); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1418801&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608145274" alt="ahshow" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1418801)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ahshow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1418801); return false;">ahshow</a></span></p>
